'''Sector 5-1-5''' was a sector on the [[desert]] [[planet]] of [[Geonosis]]. During the [[First Battle of Geonosis]], after [[Jedi]] [[Grand Master]] [[Yoda]] ordered all fire be focused on the nearest [[starship]], a [[Unidentified Clone Captain (Geonosis)|Clone Captain]] in the [[Forward Command Center]] ordered all quadrants to the sector, allowing for the [[Galactic Republic|Republic's]] [[Self-Propelled Heavy Artillery]] Turbolasers to take down a [[core ship]]. After the ship fell to the [[Ground warfare|battlefield]] below, the battle continued and was ultimately won by the Republic.<ref name="Episode II" />

